-cdn.com/metareel-images/content/posters-7-1791883730942-aIzU9bVUvqphq8rPnvAS5N1Zd5o.jpg?tr=h-350,w-230,q-60&amp;version=5" alt="Ranabaali" style="max-width:300px;float:left;margin:0 10px 10px 0;border-radius:6px;" /&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:8px;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;91Mobiles OTT&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Language&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;Telugu&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Category&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;OTT Release&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Release Date&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="padding:2px 8px;"&gt;13 Nov 2026 (OTT)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inspired by real historical events between 1854 and 1878, 'Ranabaali' is set against the backdrop of 19th-century British colonial rule in India. The film portrays the immense suffering and devastation in regions deliberately pushed into drought by imperial policies. From this 'cursed land,' a legendary hero named Ranabaali emerges to challenge the oppressive regime.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.91mobiles.com/entertainment/ranabaali-movie-221874</guid><enclosure url="https://www.91-cdn.com/metareel-images/content/posters-7-1791883730942-aIzU9bVUvqphq8rPnvAS5N1Zd5o.jpg?tr=h-350,w-230,q-60&amp;version=5" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:10:24 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>